### 测试 Elasticsearch

### ==================== 练习 2：数据同步（先录入数据） ====================

### 1. 新增商品到 ES
POST http://localhost:8080/search/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "华为 Mate60 Pro",
  "description": "鸿蒙系统旗舰手机，卫星通信",
  "price": 6999,
  "stock": 100,
  "category": "手机"
}

