### ==================== 练习 1：搜索商品 ====================

### 6. 关键词搜索（搜索"华为"）
GET http://localhost:8080/search/product?keyword=华为

### 7. 按分类过滤
GET http://localhost:8080/search/product?category=手机

### 8. 按价格范围过滤
GET http://localhost:8080/search/product?minPrice=3000&maxPrice=7000

### 9. 查询全部
GET http://localhost:8080/search/product

### ==================== 练习 2：删除 ====================

### 10. 删除商品
DELETE http://localhost:8080/search/product/5

### 11. 删除后再搜索，确认已删除
GET http://localhost:8080/search/product?keyword=索尼
